The game logic in this project is a clean-room Dart reimplementation
inspired by the classic BSD games distributed with NetBSD. The original C
source code (used for reference) carries the following notice:

  Copyright (c) 1980, 1990, 1993
      The Regents of the University of California.
  Copyright (c) 1987 Ed James, UC Berkeley.
  All rights reserved.

  Redistribution and use in source and binary forms, with or without
